# Pre-existing content of `graph` before fetchAndConvertToDCAT is called.
# graph.parse(...) MERGES into this graph rather than replacing it, so this
# is neighbouring content that must survive untouched and must not satisfy
# any of the region's patterns (no hydra:PagedCollection, no dcat:Dataset):
# the real traversal pattern (hydra pagination, dcat:Dataset subjects) lives
# in the fetched pages, which driver.py builds per call (see its docstring).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
ex:existing a ex:Note .
